[[File:ArquitensCruiser-GI.png|thumb|right|200px|The [[Arquitens-class light cruiser|''Arquitens''-class light cruiser]] was a known light cruiser.]]
{{Quote|An Imperial shuttle is advancing over the city."<br />"First, that's a light cruiser. And second, it's not Imperial.|[[CU-28]] and [[Greef Karga]]|<ref name="Spies">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 23: The Spies}}</ref>}}
'''Light cruiser''' was a designation used for a variety of [[capital ship]]s and [[warship]]s in different classification systems.<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> The [[Chiss Ascendancy]] utilized light cruisers within the [[Chiss Expansionary Defense Fleet]], with a pair of Chiss light cruisers participating in a [[Senior Captain Thrawn's last stand|battle over Sunrise]] against the [[Grysk Hegemony]] alongside a large Chiss [[fleet]],<ref name="Lesser Evil">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Lesser Evil]]''</ref> and two small light cruisers used by the Chiss [[Xodlak family]] within their [[Xodlak fleet|family fleet]].<ref name="Greater Good">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Greater Good]]''</ref>

